 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "n dependencies 0..n-1 and acyclic edges [u, v] (v needs u). Every dependency takes one time unit and starts as soon as all its prerequisites are complete, in parallel with any others. A dependency is a bottleneck when it is the only one being built at its time step. Return the bottlenecks ordered by time step (equivalently ascending build step).",
